This Is Why OIDC Exists ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐OpenID Connect

OIDC changes the model completely.

Instead of GitHub saying:

"Here is my AWS password."

GitHub says:

"Here is proof that I am the workflow running from repository company/app, on branch main, under the conditions you trust."

AWS verifies that identity and replies:

"I trust you.

Here are temporary credentials.

They expire in one hour."

No permanent AWS access key is stored in GitHub.

