This Is Where the Trust Relationship Comes In

Before any workflow runs, an administrator configures a trust policy.

Think of it as a contract.

GitHub --------------------------- AWS
          Trust Relationship

AWS says:

"I trust GitHub only if these conditions are true."

Examples:

Repository = company/my-app
Branch = main
Workflow = deploy.yml

If those conditions are met, AWS grants temporary credentials.

