⭐ This Is the Part That Most Engineers Miss

If I asked many engineers:

"Does GitHub authenticate to STS?"

They might say:

"Yes."

The more precise answer is:

GitHub presents an OIDC identity token.
AWS IAM evaluates the trust policy for the role.
If the trust policy is satisfied, AWS STS issues temporary credentials for that role.

So IAM Trust Policy decides whether STS should issue credentials, and STS is the service that actually creates those credentials.

That distinction is extremely valuable in cloud security interviews.

